 para enteder melhor sobre o seu nicho!"}, "type": "message", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 593, "height": 81}, "position": {"x": 650.6037971450804, "y": 1285.0287575902723}, "selected": false}, {"id": "delay_1786925742813_w6u3c", "data": {"unit": "segundos", "delay": 20}, "type": "delay", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 150, "height": 81}, "position": {"x": 883.382340692941, "y": 823.0761199309459}, "selected": false}, {"id": "crmAction_1786925742813_8yxho", "data": {"action": "Adicionar Etiqueta", "statusLabel": "FERRAMENTA MRO", "statusValue": "ferramenta-mro"}, "type": "crmAction", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 180, "height": 105}, "position": {"x": 738.4627122014416, "y": 682.1382471202982}, "selected": false}, {"id": "crmAction_1786925742813_o14t0", "data": {"action": "Adicionar Etiqueta", "statusLabel": "Mandou instagram", "statusValue": "mandou-instagram"}, "type": "crmAction", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 180, "height": 105}, "position": {"x": 1218.9954066912867, "y": 1467.2517165599852}, "selected": false}, {"id": "waitResponse_1786925742813_ucu3v", "data": {"timeout": 20}, "type": "waitResponse", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 220, "height": 139}, "position": {"x": 761.28340600811, "y": 1461.4520860294415}, "selected": false}, {"id": "message_1786925742813_4b475", "data": {"text": "Fico no seu aguardo."}, "type": "message", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 200, "height": 81}, "position": {"x": 1002.742735712987, "y": 1722.9783729889848}, "selected": false}, {"id": "question_1786925742813_jhk0z", "data": {"text": "Para utilizar nosso sistema *você precisa ter uma maquina para instalar você tens qual desses ? Não funciona apenas em celular*\\n\\nQual você tens?", "buttons": [{"id": "opt1", "text": "Notebook/Pc"}, {"id": "opt2", "text": "Macbook"}, {"id": "btn-1784505878240", "url": "", "text": "Não tenho nenhum!"}], "anyResponse": false}, "type": "question", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 657, "height": 254}, "position": {"x": 524.7670551582113, "y": 206.14549597984472}, "selected": false}, {"id": "message_1786925742813_oox3c", "data": {"text": "Infelizmente, *é necessário ter um computador para instalar o nosso sistema, pois ele não funciona em celulares.* \\n\\n\\n\\nUma dica é investir em você e adquirir pelo menos um notebook básico. Esse é o mínimo necessário para trabalhar com redes sociais e também para empreender com mais eficiência."}, "type": "message", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 892, "height": 141}, "position": {"x": 1839.111099916836, "y": 587.624500513184}, "selected": false}, {"id": "question_1786925742813_oahak", "data": {"text": "*Gostaria de saber sobre a ferramenta MRO* mesmo assim?", "buttons": [{"id": "opt1", "text": "Sim"}, {"id": "opt2", "text": "Não,obrigado!"}], "anyResponse": false}, "type": "question", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 330, "height": 184}, "position": {"x": 1439.499029299977, "y": 892.3428566066418}, "selected": false}, {"id": "delay_1786925742813_0b5y6", "data": {"unit": "segundos", "delay": 2}, "type": "delay", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 150, "height": 81}, "position": {"x": 588.4816953341275, "y": -54.89988953501828}, "selected": false}, {"id": "message_1786925835072", "data": {"text": "https://youtu.be/TBKaNXAUfmc"}, "type": "message", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 200, "height": 81}, "position": {"x": 883.2491709128972, "y": 947.004448498634}, "selected": false}, {"id": "question_1786925951079", "data": {"text": "Chegou a ver nossa proposta no video acima?", "buttons": [{"id": "opt1", "text": "Sim"}, {"id": "opt2", "text": "Ainda não"}], "anyResponse": false}, "type": "question", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 262, "height": 184}, "position": {"x": 1594.5154374518145, "y": 1531.602651039685}, "selected": false}, {"id": "video_1786926204308", "data": {"fileName": "ACADEMIA.mp4", "videoUrl": "https://aossudsganqiapcoqthe.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/crm-media/flow-media/ke1jx21n3g9_1786926229068.mp4"}, "type": "video", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 200, "height": 81}, "position": {"x": 2282.925050916542, "y": 1567.0226465797173}, "selected": false}, {"id": "delay_1786926211894", "data": {"unit": "segundos", "delay": 20}, "type": "delay", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 150, "height": 81}, "position": {"x": 2066.2643643714237, "y": 1448.3619627338323}, "selected": false}, {"id": "message_1786926233797", "data": {"text": "Veja como é Rapido e direto ! \\n\\n*Trouxemos o público-alvo interessado e realizamos disparos de mensagens em massa, aumentando as oportunidades de conversão.*\\n\\n*Mais vendas, mais clientes e tudo no automático, sem precisar gastar com anúncios.*"}, "type": "message", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 666, "height": 141}, "position": {"x": 2420.7976353936147, "y": 1697.2456683985788}, "selected": false}, {"id": "message_1786926275253", "data": {"text": "Perfeito! Esse desconto não vai durar muito tempo. *Caso você realmente queira vender mais, ter mais engajamento e conquistar novos clientes* investindo pouco, essa é uma ótima oportunidade.\\n\\n- Quando conseguir assistir, me retorna. *Vou estar por aqui para te ajudar!*\\n"}, "type": "message", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 955, "height": 111}, "position": {"x": 1362.766198290167, "y": 1825.0153624983966}, "selected": false}, {"id": "question_1786927024938", "data": {"text": "*Atendimento finalizado*\\n\\nSegue nosso instagram !", "buttons": [{"id": "opt_1786927024938", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/maisresultadosonline/", "text": "ACESSAR "}], "fileName": "ja-ajudamos.jpg", "imageUrl": "https://aossudsganqiapcoqthe.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/crm-media/flow-media/n5weg8u23i_1786927039550.jpg", "videoUrl": "", "anyResponse": false}, "type": "question", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 250, "height": 173}, "position": {"x": 1977.8838500951606, "y": 1063.6342995943505}, "selected": false}, {"id": "delay_1786929669357", "data": {"unit": "segundos", "delay": 70}, "type": "delay", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 150, "height": 81}, "position": {"x": 978.513967272176, "y": 1079.6653967977184}, "selected": false}, {"id": "audio_1786929686125", "data": {"isPTT": true, "audioUrl": "https://aossudsganqiapcoqthe.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/crm-media/flow-media/z1vpvj1dxlr_1786929698092.ogg", "fileName": "audio expli estamos  bot.ogg"}, "type": "audio", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 200, "height": 81}, "position": {"x": 1209.947295699813, "y": 1099.4198543821371}, "selected": false}, {"id": "question_1786929709261", "data": {"text": "Como gostaria de direcionar?", "buttons": [{"id": "opt1", "text": "VALORES ?"}, {"id": "opt2", "text": "Tirar dúvidas?"}], "anyResponse": false}, "type": "question", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 250, "height": 184}, "position": {"x": 1366.4852116379243, "y": 1208.3894847375027}, "selected": false}, {"id": "message_1786929760693", "data": {"text": "Perfeito, estamos direcionado você em instantes retornaremos seu contato."}, "type": "message", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 383, "height": 81}, "position": {"x": 1697.0282993471437, "y": 1339.1457729991907}, "selected": false}, {"id": "jump_1786929804221", "data": {"targetFlowId": "48bf5212-5308-4214-a725-e93acdf5ad45", "targetFlowName": "VALORES SEM EXPLICA~~AO"}, "type": "jump", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 200, "height": 81}, "position": {"x": 1675.1716020484268, "y": 1151.9892833004324}, "selected": false}, {"id": "waitResponse_1786931277958", "data": {"timeout": 20}, "type": "waitResponse", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 220, "height": 139}, "position": {"x": 2565.2770185918066, "y": 2071.459727552444}, "selected": false}, {"id": "waitResponse_1786931310998", "data": {"timeout": 120}, "type": "waitResponse", "dragging": false, "measured": {"width": 220, "height": 139}, "position": {"x": 1719